1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,291
The structure of a skill is deliberate.

2
00:00:02,241 --> 00:00:06,275
SKILL.md is the brain — the agent reads it every time the skill triggers.

3
00:00:06,275 --> 00:00:12,308
The references folder is the library — things the agent can look up when it needs detail, like API schemas or architecture docs.

4
00:00:12,308 --> 00:00:16,391
Scripts are the hands — deterministic code that runs when the workflow needs precision.

5
00:00:16,391 --> 00:00:20,375
And assets are the templates — boilerplate files the agent can copy and customize.

6
00:00:20,375 --> 00:00:24,200
This separation matters because it controls what goes into the context window and when.

